        "raw": "<p>May is not there for &quot;you may choose one of these, or not&quot;, it is there for &quot;you may chose a different option for each card&quot;.</p><p>Primary rule of Sentinels is <u>Read the cards literally</u>, there is no option to put it back on the deck, so you can&#39;t do that with this card. The options that you &quot;may&quot; select from are draw, discard or play, for each card separately. If you do not choose from one of those selected options then the game has stalled as Syntactic Analysis is still waiting for the 2 revealed cards to be played, drawn or discarded.</p>",
